= KriolOS POS - Internationalization (i18n) & Translation Tool
:toc: manual

This directory contains automation tooling for managing translations across KriolOS POS modules.

== Setup Virtual Environment

[source,bash]
----
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
----

== Usage

=== 1. Audit Missing Keys
Reports missing translation keys across all supported languages without modifying files:
[source,bash]
----
python translate_properties.py --audit
----

=== 2. Initialize / Scaffold All Projects
Ensures all 11 language modules are created in `kriolos-opos-i18n/`, registered in `kriolos-opos-i18n/pom.xml`, and have their SPI providers:
[source,bash]
----
python translate_properties.py --init-all
----

=== 3. Translate Specific Language(s)
Translate one or more languages using Google Translation:
[source,bash]
----
python translate_properties.py --langs es,fr,ar
----

=== 4. Translate All Languages
Translates missing keys across all languages in `TARGET_LANGS`:
[source,bash]
----
python translate_properties.py --all
----

=== 5. Sort Properties
Re-sorts all `.properties` files alphabetically (case-insensitive) while preserving comments:
[source,bash]
----
python translate_properties.py --sort
----

