== SPI Architecture

Every language module is an independent Java modular JAR providing the `com.openbravo.pos.spi.i18n.I18nProvider` SPI via `java.util.ServiceLoader`.

- Contracts are marked with `@com.openbravo.pos.spi.annotation.PluginContract`.
- `PluginManager` dynamically discovers and registers SPI contracts without hardcoded classes.
- Applications discover installed language packages via `com.openbravo.pos.spi.i18n.I18nFactory.getInstance().getAvailableProviders()`.